# A three-seat couch seen from behind, facing something on the back wall,
# like the TV. Staff sit on it facing away from the viewer, and its back
# hides their lower half (zbias 1).
sprite break-couch-back
size 48 24
layer object
footprint 3 1
origin 0 8
zbias 1
tag couch seat rest
spot seat-0 0 0 up rest sit
spot seat-1 1 0 up rest sit
spot seat-2 2 0 up rest sit
variant teal r=t R=T 8=6
variant sage r=s R=S 8=0

frame default
